    "Add colorful, rainbow-like glows around titles and bright areas in any shot. Creates multi-chromatic diffuse glows or sharp-edged highlights.",
    "Chromatic Glow offers a diverse collection of presets that showcase various colorful glow results. Find these via the blue Open Dashboard... button or the Choose a Preset... button below it.",
    "As with all other Universe tools, you can modify or create a Chromatic Glow look and then save it under its own name by pressing the Save Preset... button."
